{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1511016001:0":{"text":"艾雅，可恨的艾雅……","source_cn":"艾雅，可恨的艾雅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80A629499583FF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511016002:1":{"text":"为什么要踏足我的神域，为什么要来干涉我与珀尔修斯的命运？！","source_cn":"为什么要踏足我的神域，为什么要来干涉我与珀尔修斯的命运？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB02054CE0A02ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511016003:1":{"text":"生命树不是你一个人的所有物！行使你的神权，让珀尔修斯回来，回到我身边！","source_cn":"生命树不是你一个人的所有物！行使你的神权，让珀尔修斯回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9B74C1FA8BEED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511016004:0":{"text":"……生命的规则，只能遵守，那也并非我能撼动之物。","source_cn":"……生命的规则，只能遵守，那也并非我能撼动之物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259299E6845591F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511016005:0":{"text":"神权……？生命的规则？","source_cn":"神权……？生命的规则？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17819FC0A78C08B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511016006:0":{"text":"梅林，你瞒了我什么？","source_cn":"梅林，你瞒了我什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0240E37C8BE9AE03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511016007:0":{"text":"你们与她同行一路，竟然不知她是谁。","source_cn":"你们与她同行一路，竟然不知她是谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86300F841BB01FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511016008:1":{"text":"伟大的——崇高的<style=\"highlight\">生命女神</style>！你对凡人许下了多少谎言？谎言才该是你的领域！","source_cn":"伟大的——崇高的<style=highlight>生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x238B0F66E6C5D5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511016009:0":{"text":"看看你身边那个兽人孩子——她明明是我的信徒，却用仇视的眼神看着我！","source_cn":"看看你身边那个兽人孩子——她明明是我的信徒，却用仇视的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4913F277EDAA1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511016010:1":{"text":"我的疆土，我的信徒，我的造物，我的爱……你再也不能夺走了！","source_cn":"我的疆土，我的信徒，我的造物，我的爱……你再也不能夺走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDD2F2AE9DE69DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511016011:1":{"text":"梅林……是神？","source_cn":"梅林……是神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C2FAEEADA93F7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511016012:1":{"text":"闭嘴，叛徒，你是我的造物，本应崇敬我！","source_cn":"闭嘴，叛徒，你是我的造物，本应崇敬我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF8F92229CD39494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511016013:0":{"text":"……我已经不崇敬任何神。","source_cn":"……我已经不崇敬任何神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC49CFDA33F61EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511016014:0":{"text":"我信仰，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人！","source_cn":"我信仰，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C64126687A1A3E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我信仰，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人！","female":"我信仰，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人！","variant_male_record_index":"175883","variant_female_record_index":"175884","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511016015:0":{"text":"——够了！等我唤回珀尔修斯，就让你回归生命树！","source_cn":"——够了！等我唤回珀尔修斯，就让你回归生命树！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7C0BC43FBDFC9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511016016:0":{"text":"你救不了珀尔修斯，奥法迦。","source_cn":"你救不了珀尔修斯，奥法迦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28CA5BD2C87BCBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511016017:0":{"text":"凡人皆是生命树上的一枚叶片。当叶片凋落，凡人也迎来生命的终结——死亡。","source_cn":"凡人皆是生命树上的一枚叶片。当叶片凋落，凡人也迎来生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC7715296A79024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1511016018:0":{"text":"认清现实吧，奥法迦。属于珀尔修斯的那一片叶已经凋落，他的灵魂已回归生命树。即使相同的位置再生出新叶，也不再是你所钟爱的那个人。","source_cn":"认清现实吧，奥法迦。属于珀尔修斯的那一片叶已经凋落，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x190A915D491AE0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1511016019:0":{"text":"除非你向死神祈求……但一位神，会向另一位神祈求吗？","source_cn":"除非你向死神祈求……但一位神，会向另一位神祈求吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F95036A2C7EF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1511016020:0":{"text":"谁又知道死神现在何方呢？","source_cn":"谁又知道死神现在何方呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF4A49BBF595A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1511016021:1":{"text":"不……死神休想染指珀尔修斯的灵魂，我禁止他的死亡！","source_cn":"不……死神休想染指珀尔修斯的灵魂，我禁止他的死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED0F3D29F180C15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1511016022:0":{"text":"你我皆是神！你能赐予生命，我为何不能——？！","source_cn":"你我皆是神！你能赐予生命，我为何不能——？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x446826B08CA483E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1511016023:0":{"text":"她还在抽取生命树的力量！","source_cn":"她还在抽取生命树的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224B612681F1DD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1511016024:0":{"text":"奥法迦……","source_cn":"奥法迦……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1625AA20721FFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1511016025:1":{"text":"——休想再阻止我！","source_cn":"——休想再阻止我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B8A867E13B07F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1511016026:0":{"text":"我会成功的……<style=\"highlight\">他马上就会醒过来了</style>！","source_cn":"我会成功的……<style=highlight>他马上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76DF4E8C2DC4EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t